+// ~92k-file Electron app payload that fans out into tens of thousands of
+// simultaneously held descriptors and dies with EMFILE: too many open files
+// during the pre-signing walk, regardless of any ulimit raise
+// (kern.maxfilesperproc caps the process at 10240 on stock macOS). A counting
+// semaphore keeps held fds bounded no matter how large the tree is. stat /
+// readdir / remove go through fs-extra (graceful-fs) and need no cap.
